Subject: [PATCH 065/230] Fix A-ADS bot verification and add full-stack auth
 debug logging
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A-ADS bot crawls the static HTML, so the ad iframe is now embedded in
index.html (hidden) so it ships in the initial response. The client can
still manage placement.

Telegram auth debugging: all auth-probe guest logging and the
requireUser initData-failure log now always emit (no AUTH_PROBE gate),
and useAuth's enterApp logs are no longer dev-only, so the exact failure
path is visible in both Render and browser consoles.

Checks: typecheck, lint (2 pre-existing warnings only), prettier,
tests passing, production build OK.

